{
    "title": "Big Bus Tours",
    "description": "Experience the best of the city with our Big Bus Tours app. It's the perfect global travel buddy, packed with a variety of indispensable features to help you make the most of your sightseeing experience in each of our 20+ cities.\r\nOur app is FREE to download, with key features including:\r\n- OVER 20 CITIES WORLDWIDE in the palm of your hand. Easily switch between cities, with no additional downloads required when you move on to your next adventure!\r\n- REAL-TIME BUS TRACKING lets you see the real-time location and stop arrival times of our Big Buses\r\n- INTERACTIVE MAPS display our Big Bus tour routes, stop locations, landmarks and attractions\r\n- STOP DETAILS include accurate pins on our maps, with supporting location photographs, addresses, descriptions and walking directions from your current location\r\n- SERVICE ALERTS keep you updated about any anticipated changes to service, with further detailed information in the app message inbox\r\n- ATTRACTIONS MENU showing you the location of all the best local landmarks, attractions, shopping, dining and things to do, complete with interesting facts, visitor information and special offers for selected attractions\r\n- TICKET BOOKING lets you purchase Big Bus tour and attraction tickets quickly and securely, with multiple payment options available",
    "descriptionHTML": "Experience the best of the city with our Big Bus Tours app. It&#39;s the perfect global travel buddy, packed with a variety of indispensable features to help you make the most of your sightseeing experience in each of our 20+ cities.<br>Our app is FREE to download, with key features including:<br>- OVER 20 CITIES WORLDWIDE in the palm of your hand. Easily switch between cities, with no additional downloads required when you move on to your next adventure!<br>- REAL-TIME BUS TRACKING lets you see the real-time location and stop arrival times of our Big Buses<br>- INTERACTIVE MAPS display our Big Bus tour routes, stop locations, landmarks and attractions<br>- STOP DETAILS include accurate pins on our maps, with supporting location photographs, addresses, descriptions and walking directions from your current location<br>- SERVICE ALERTS keep you updated about any anticipated changes to service, with further detailed information in the app message inbox<br>- ATTRACTIONS MENU showing you the location of all the best local landmarks, attractions, shopping, dining and things to do, complete with interesting facts, visitor information and special offers for selected attractions<br>- TICKET BOOKING lets you purchase Big Bus tour and attraction tickets quickly and securely, with multiple payment options available",
